### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 6, 2022
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-15-22 for furnishing Two (2) New Small Articulated
Loaders, and One (1) New Heavy Duty Utility Vehicle, for the City of Cheyenne,
Community Recreation & Events Department
______________________________________________
Bid #E-15-22 was solicited for furnishing Two (2) New Small Articulated Loaders, and One (1)
New Heavy Duty Utility Vehicle, for the City of Cheyenne, Community Recreation & Events
Department.

A Mandatory Pre-Bid Meeting was held, and One (1) Bidder, Bobcat of the Rockies, was in
attendance.

One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Bid was received from:
1. Bobcat of the Rockies, Cheyenne, Wyoming.
The bids were reviewed by Tina Worthman (Botanic Gardens), Ron Conard (Golf), Matt Titus
(Turf Shop), and Jason Sanchez (CRE).  Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive
bid from Bobcat of the Rockies, for the purchase of Two (2) New Small Articulated Loaders, and
One (1) New Heavy Duty Utility Vehicle.  The total cost, less Trade Ins, is $186,380.00.

Funding:
020-26-2614-45-43102 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Equipment)
```

